  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.5.0\n\n### Additions\n* Added window creation property and relevant fluent builder method to ``Command`` class\n* Add missing xml doc comments\n* Add missing xml doc comments to ``CliRunner.Specializations``\n* Add ``ExecuteAsync`` method with Encoding parameter\n* Add ``Run`` extension methods for ``Command`` class\n* Added method implementation in ``AbstractSpecializedCommand`` class\n\n### General Changes\n* Removed unnecessary usage of Administrator privilege configuration in ``CliRunner.Specializations``\n* Renamed static ``Create()`` methods of ``CliRunner.Specializations`` Command classes with ``Run()``\n* Optimized CliRunner Specializations Command classes\n* Renamed ``UseShellExecute`` property to ``UseShellExecution`` in ``Command`` class\n* Increased code re-use across ``Command`` execution methods\n* Fixed some typos and xml doc comment mistakes",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
